WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:02.879
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:02.879 --> 00:00:08.590
Today I am going to explain an Australian
romantic comedy film called “Long Story

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:09.590
Short.”

00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:10.690
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:17.019
Watch out and take care!

00:00:17.019 --> 00:00:19.590
The movie starts at a New Year's Eve party.

00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:25.240
The protagonist is named Teddy, a guy who
doesn’t value time and is a massive procrastinator.

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:28.660
He arrives at the party when the countdown
to the new year begins.

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:32.369
He sees his girlfriend on the other end and
kisses her right at twelve o’clock.

00:00:32.369 --> 00:00:37.450
But Teddy soon realizes that he is kissing
a stranger wearing the exact same dress as

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:38.700
his girlfriend.

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:43.200
He quickly draws back and apologies to the
lady who excuses his genuine mistake.

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:47.480
Out of embarrassment, he buys her a drink
which she happily accepts.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.480
The woman introduces herself as Leanne.

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:53.820
As they two talk, Teddy begins to cough and
shake violently.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:57.970
It turns out that she had eaten something
with nuts before Teddy kissed her which triggered

00:00:57.970 --> 00:00:59.250
his allergy.

00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:02.330
She brings him to the side and tries to calm
him down.

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:06.790
Right then, Teddy’s girlfriend Becka approaches
them and sees that he is having an allergic

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:07.790
reaction.

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:10.900
They get an EpiPen from somewhere and save
Teddy.

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:13.430
After that incident, Teddy and Leanne start
to date.

00:01:13.430 --> 00:01:18.400
They are a happy couple for the next four
years but being the procrastinator he is,

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:21.720
Teddy proposes to her only on their fifth
year together.

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.810
After the proposal, the couple visits Teddy’s
dad’s grave.

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:28.840
They tell him how the proposal went while
an old lady listens from afar.

00:01:28.840 --> 00:01:33.070
When Leanne leaves Teddy for some time, the
old woman congratulates him.

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:37.360
She asks him when the wedding is and Teddy
replies he hasn’t thought about it yet.

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:41.790
The woman senses his carelessness with time
and questions what he would do if a year went

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:45.560
by in a minute and he didn’t have enough
time to live his life.

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:49.520
Her question makes Teddy uncomfortable but
the woman doesn’t stop there.

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:52.550
She tells him that she has a perfect wedding
gift for him.

00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:55.620
By then, Leanne returns and greets the woman.

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:59.729
As they chat, the woman mentions that Teddy
said their wedding is in two weeks.

00:01:59.729 --> 00:02:04.409
Leanne gets very excited and hugs Teddy, so
he goes along with the lie.

00:02:04.409 --> 00:02:09.390
Two weeks after the incident, they get married.

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:13.280
At their wedding, Teddy’s best friend Sam
gives a speech about their friendship and

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:15.500
jokes about his habits with time.

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:19.400
The couple is beyond happy when they return
to their newly bought home.

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:23.560
They plan to unbox their belongings and start
decoration from the next day.

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:27.980
For a few minutes, Leanne goes into the bathroom
to change and Teddy goes through their wedding

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:28.980
presents.

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:32.040
One of them is a tiny house plant which they
agree to name Groot.

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:37.230
But the one that catches Teddy’s eye is
a box that says “Do not open for ten years”.

00:02:37.230 --> 00:02:41.040
He opens the box and sees a tin can inside.

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:45.360
The can also has something inside it which
Teddy plans to open with a can opener.

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:49.160
However, Leanne comes out of the bathroom,
so he gets distracted.

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:53.320
The night ends and when Teddy wakes up the
following morning, he is shocked to see the

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:55.100
bedroom fully decorated.

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:58.500
He jokes saying that Leanne really did everything
before breakfast.

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:03.120
But things get weirder when he walks out of
the room to their fully colored and decorated

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:04.120
home.

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:07.670
The house plant Groot has grown overnight
as well.

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:12.180
Confused, he turns around to see a pregnant
Leanne standing behind him.

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:17.010
Teddy laughs thinking that it is a prank but
little does he know, he has time-traveled

00:03:17.010 --> 00:03:19.050
a year into the future.

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:23.070
Teddy inspects her belly and registers that
she is actually pregnant.

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:27.460
He questions what is going on because they
got married just yesterday but Leanne thinks

00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:29.320
he is just playing with her.

00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:34.319
She asks for her one-year anniversary present
which makes Teddy believe he might have Alzheimer’s.

00:03:34.319 --> 00:03:37.520
Leanne ignores him and hands him his present.

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:42.160
Teddy is still very confused so Leanne asks
him to lie down for a while.

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:45.920
As he lays on the bed, things around him start
to fade.

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:48.860
In the next second, a year passes.

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:53.130
Teddy wakes up and runs into Leanne who is
clearly not pregnant.

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:57.900
He laughs thinking that he had just had a
bad dream but as they chat, a baby’s cry

00:03:57.900 --> 00:03:59.709
is heard from the other room.

00:03:59.709 --> 00:04:03.930
Teddy looks around and sees many pictures
of him and Leanne that he clearly doesn’t

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:04.930
remember taking.

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:09.280
But he is even more surprised after seeing
their daughter Tallulah.

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:13.210
He holds her for the first time and feels
magical.

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:17.189
After arguing about Tallulah’s name, he
tells Leanne he might have traveled through

00:04:17.189 --> 00:04:19.699
time, but she just laughs it off.

00:04:19.699 --> 00:04:24.240
Teddy then inquires about the past year only
to find out that he has been away from home

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:26.020
for work half of the time.

00:04:26.020 --> 00:04:31.279
Then, Leanne asks him to quit his job and
pursue photography, which he actually wants

00:04:31.279 --> 00:04:32.819
to do in life.

00:04:32.819 --> 00:04:37.810
Teddy is surprised that he hasn’t started
photography even after two years of marriage.

00:04:37.810 --> 00:04:42.979
Moreover, he never took Leanne on a honeymoon
because of his habit of procrastination.

00:04:42.979 --> 00:04:47.830
Teddy feels guilty for all this so he calls
his friend Sam and asks him to come to his

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:52.379
house the same day next year with an anniversary
present.

00:04:52.379 --> 00:04:57.520
Following that, he places an orange in Groot’s
pot to see if he will actually time travel.

00:04:57.520 --> 00:05:00.979
The time changes again and now it is their
third anniversary.

00:05:00.979 --> 00:05:06.159
The orange has rotten and dried and Groot
has grown exponentially bigger.

00:05:06.159 --> 00:05:09.729
Sam arrives outside confused about a reminder
on his phone.

00:05:09.729 --> 00:05:12.719
Teddy hugs him and asks him for the anniversary
present.

00:05:12.719 --> 00:05:17.469
But Sam has brought a little pony thinking
that he meant a “nursery present”.

00:05:17.469 --> 00:05:21.839
Teddy explains everything that is going on
to Sam but he doesn’t believe him.

00:05:21.839 --> 00:05:26.629
Upon insisting, Sam associates the incident
to the movie Groundhog Day, and asks Teddy

00:05:26.629 --> 00:05:34.220
to make his life perfect in order to end the
loop.

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:38.430
Teddy asks him to set a reminder for the same
day next year and leaves.

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:43.619
At home, he meets little Tallulah and is mad
that “daddy” wasn’t her first word.

00:05:43.619 --> 00:05:47.279
Leanne says that he is rarely home with her
because of work.

00:05:47.279 --> 00:05:51.710
Teddy also finds out that he and Leanne are
going to couples therapy because of marital

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:52.800
problems.

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:56.900
He reads a letter that the current Teddy has
written to Leanne where he says that she should

00:05:56.900 --> 00:05:59.639
stop pursuing her dream to become a writer.

00:05:59.639 --> 00:06:05.219
Leanne reads it too and accuses him of being
jealous because he never pursued photography.

00:06:05.219 --> 00:06:09.849
Teddy is disappointed in himself seeing how
much he has changed in the years.

00:06:09.849 --> 00:06:13.349
In the very next second, another year goes
by as well.

00:06:13.349 --> 00:06:16.270
He calls for Leanne but she doesn’t answer.

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:20.399
Following that, Sam arrives at the house and
informs Teddy that he and Leanne are in a

00:06:20.399 --> 00:06:25.559
trial separation, meaning they have decided
to spend time away from each other for a while.

00:06:25.559 --> 00:06:30.719
He quickly calls Leanne and wishes her a happy
anniversary trying to get his life back together

00:06:30.719 --> 00:06:32.599
and end the time travel.

00:06:32.599 --> 00:06:35.470
But she refuses to meet him when he invites
her.

00:06:35.470 --> 00:06:39.479
Teddy opens the fridge to get a drink and
the time changes again.

00:06:39.479 --> 00:06:43.650
This time, he walks to the other room and
kisses a woman thinking she is Leanne but

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:49.289
it turns out to be his ex-girlfriend Becka.

00:06:49.289 --> 00:06:52.849
She tells him that they have been seeing each
other for a few months now and that Leanne

00:06:52.849 --> 00:06:55.740
and he are still in a trial separation.

00:06:55.740 --> 00:06:58.539
Becka used to be married but has gotten a
divorce.

00:06:58.539 --> 00:07:02.409
As Teddy tries to get her out of the house,
Leanne knocks on the door.

00:07:02.409 --> 00:07:05.479
He hides Becka in the balcony and lets Leanne
in.

00:07:05.479 --> 00:07:09.659
She tells him that she misses him and that
they should end the separation and get back

00:07:09.659 --> 00:07:10.659
together.

00:07:10.659 --> 00:07:15.279
Teddy is overjoyed to hear this and kisses
her but she notices Becka’s undergarments

00:07:15.279 --> 00:07:16.429
on the couch.

00:07:16.429 --> 00:07:20.580
She registers that Teddy has been seeing someone
else and asks for a divorce.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:24.009
Teddy tries to calm her down but Leanne storms
out.

00:07:24.009 --> 00:07:27.779
After that, Becka sarcastically offers Teddy
a divorce lawyer.

00:07:27.779 --> 00:07:32.649
Before making her leave, he asks her not to
pick his phone calls or answer his texts if

00:07:32.649 --> 00:07:34.759
he tries to contact her again.

00:07:34.759 --> 00:07:38.419
When Teddy turns around, Becka is in the kitchen
in different clothes.

00:07:38.419 --> 00:07:40.770
An entire year has passed again.

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:45.490
He finds out that he and Leanne are still
separated and Becka has moved in with him.

00:07:45.490 --> 00:07:48.830
Teddy quickly calls Sam and asks him to meet
outside.

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:51.999
Following that, he tells Becka that he is
still in love with Leanne.

00:07:51.999 --> 00:07:57.080
Becka, too, tells him that she loves her ex-husband
and has made the biggest mistake of her life

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:58.509
separating from him.

00:07:58.509 --> 00:08:03.339
The two bond with each other and decide to
end their relationship.

00:08:03.339 --> 00:08:07.639
A while later, Sam arrives in his sports car
and picks Teddy up.

00:08:07.639 --> 00:08:11.919
As they talk, Teddy gets to know that Sam
has been diagnosed with cancer and there is

00:08:11.919 --> 00:08:14.219
very little chance of his survival.

00:08:14.219 --> 00:08:18.939
Teddy is left speechless and makes Sam promise
he will be alive when he returns the next

00:08:18.939 --> 00:08:19.939
year.

00:08:19.939 --> 00:08:24.409
The two share an emotional conversation before
Teddy goes to meet Leanne in her new home.

00:08:24.409 --> 00:08:27.419
Leanne asks him if he signed the divorce papers.

00:08:27.419 --> 00:08:29.539
Teddy is taken aback by the comment.

00:08:29.539 --> 00:08:33.900
He registers that she has filed for divorce
and he has been refusing to sign the papers

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:35.370
for the past year.

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:39.630
He asks her to get back together with him
but Leanne urges him to go away knowing that

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:41.080
he is with Becka.

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:45.280
As she closes the door on him, the time changes
again to one year later.

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:49.920
Teddy accidentally falls into Tallulah’s
pool and is approached by Leanne’s new boyfriend

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:50.940
Patrick.

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:55.540
He freaks out and starts insulting him only
to realize that Leanne is finally happy with

00:08:55.540 --> 00:08:56.540
a man.

00:08:56.540 --> 00:09:00.430
He is also informed that Leanne lost her wedding
ring in the ocean.

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:05.080
Seeing her enjoy life again, he signs the
divorce papers and has an emotional breakdown

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:06.600
in front of Patrick.

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:10.520
To cheer Teddy up a little, Leanne allows
him to take her dog for a walk.

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:14.570
Teddy and the dog go to the beach where he
sits thinking about life.

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:19.290
A year passes in some seconds and Teddy is
seen with a full beard.

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:23.630
He is still on the beach with the dog when
he notices a chocolate bar with nuts lying

00:09:23.630 --> 00:09:24.770
on the ground.

00:09:24.770 --> 00:09:29.390
He thinks of eating it to commit suicide but
stops when a seven-year-old Tallulah calls

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:30.390
him.

00:09:30.390 --> 00:09:33.080
She is happily making sandcastles behind him.

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:41.890
Teddy is in shock to see his little girl all
grown up.

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:44.050
Talking to her gives him a reason to live.

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:46.730
He takes her back to Leanne after the playdate.

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:49.750
He and Leanne have a good chat for a long
time.

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:54.680
After she goes inside, Teddy remembers it’s
their anniversary and knocks on the door.

00:09:54.680 --> 00:09:58.030
Right then the time fast forwards again to
a year later.

00:09:58.030 --> 00:10:00.840
Teddy’s beard is gone and he has glasses
now.

00:10:00.840 --> 00:10:03.780
Leanne is not in the house so he calls Sam
again.

00:10:03.780 --> 00:10:07.980
But to his surprise, the operator says that
the number doesn’t exist anymore.

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:12.190
Teddy quickly goes to his social media and
sees pictures of them at the hospital while

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:14.100
Sam was battling cancer.

00:10:14.100 --> 00:10:18.230
Eventually, he finds out that Sam has died
in the past year.

00:10:18.230 --> 00:10:21.830
Filled with grief at the loss, he visits Sam’s
grave.

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:25.510
While talking to the grave, the old woman
from earlier approaches him.

00:10:25.510 --> 00:10:29.150
She tells him that she knows he has aged ten
years in the past hour.

00:10:29.150 --> 00:10:32.550
Teddy, in shock, questions her what is going
on.

00:10:32.550 --> 00:10:36.580
The woman claims she gave him the power to
live life in snapshots.

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:40.580
She further explains that she was about to
marry a man in her twenties when she met a

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:42.680
stranger who gave her the same gift.

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:48.070
She, too, saw her life in snapshots and as
a result, didn’t marry the man.

00:10:48.070 --> 00:10:50.970
Instead, she married the woman she loved.

00:10:50.970 --> 00:10:55.720
Still confused, Teddy calls the woman a lesbian
wizard who has cast a curse on him.

00:10:55.720 --> 00:10:59.730
She clarifies that there is a way to turn
time back and live life with the knowledge

00:10:59.730 --> 00:11:01.040
he has gained.

00:11:01.040 --> 00:11:04.380
Teddy remembers the tin can he got as a gift
for his wedding.

00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:08.000
He quickly rushes to Leanne’s and asks her
if she still has it.

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:13.090
Leanne brings the box out and also informs
Teddy that she and Patrick are broken up.

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:16.450
She reveals that Patrick thought she was still
in love with Teddy.

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:21.690
Teddy suddenly figures out what is inside
the can and hands it to Leanne as their tenth-anniversary

00:11:21.690 --> 00:11:22.690
present.

00:11:22.690 --> 00:11:25.760
Leanne opens it and finds her wedding ring
inside.

00:11:25.760 --> 00:11:30.181
Teddy then proposes to her again saying that
they both love each other and life to too

00:11:30.181 --> 00:11:32.990
short to not be with the person you love.

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:38.240
Leanne states that it is so much more complicated
than that but eventually agrees to marry him.

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:41.950
Suddenly, the time changes to the day after
Teddy’s wedding.

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:46.010
He wakes up to Leanne wishing him a happy
first day as her husband.

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:49.120
He hugs her tightly and rushes to book their
honeymoon.

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:54.490
Overjoyed with emotions, he calls his boss
and quits his job saying that he will be a

00:11:54.490 --> 00:11:55.490
photographer.

00:11:55.490 --> 00:11:59.920
Next, he calls Sam and asks him to go for
a cancer screening every year on the same

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:09.060
day and threatens to drag him to the hospital
if he doesn’t.

00:12:09.060 --> 00:12:16.070
He then runs to the magical can with an intention
of giving it to Becka, who he knows needs

00:12:16.070 --> 00:12:17.070
it.

00:12:17.070 --> 00:12:21.880
The movie ends as Teddy tells Leanne that
they can do everything they like in life right

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:23.300
at that moment.

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:27.750
